description	"Dash Rendar 

A highly mobile Jetpacker with regenerating Fuel, a rapid-fire, low damage Pistol and a Pulse Cannon.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 5% slower RoF
- Dash's DL-44 Heavy Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 57% faster RoF
-- 15% less damage
- Dash's Pulse Cannon (Repeater 2)
-- 10% more damage
-- 40% slower RoF
- PLX-2M Rocket Launcher (8)
-- Staggers/pushes on hit
-- 15% more velocity
-- 50% slower reload
- 3 Frag Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- 50% slower skill cooldown
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Healing (1)
- Fuel Regen (2)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Dash / Dash Jump (2) ^3[CS3]

One of the many smugglers-cum-heroes that the Rebellion has produced, Dash Rendar is a man similar to Lando Calrissian and Han Solo in that his first loyalty is to himself. However, the Empire serves to stifle his freedom, so he fights it whenever and wherever he can."